1
00:00:00,886 --> 00:00:03,191
This video is for the finance team.

2
00:00:03,191 --> 00:00:09,975
You will learn how to follow spending, see what each doctor costs, fix catalog prices, and decide which

3
00:00:09,975 --> 00:00:11,226
doctors see prices.

4
00:00:11,677 --> 00:00:16,337
Sign in with your name and password. Your page opens on Finance.

5
00:00:17,454 --> 00:00:25,754
Choose the period: one month, cumulative up to a date, or all time. You can also filter by branch. Then tap Update.

6
00:00:26,205 --> 00:00:33,347
The cards show the value requested, the value approved, what the doctor review saved, what was sent and

7
00:00:33,347 --> 00:00:35,635
received, and emergency spending.

8
00:00:36,086 --> 00:00:41,626
The chart shows spending over the last twelve months, and the tables split it by branch and by clinic.

9
00:00:42,078 --> 00:00:46,983
Doctor billing: a fixed doctor carries all the consumables of their clinic.

10
00:00:46,983 --> 00:00:52,738
A box doctor carries only what is requested in their name. Each request is counted once.

11
00:00:53,188 --> 00:00:55,991
Catalog prices: edit any price and tap Save.

12
00:00:55,991 --> 00:01:00,704
It is written straight to the sheet as a number, and the change is logged.

13
00:01:00,704 --> 00:01:03,698
Show only the wrong prices to fix them quickly.

14
00:01:04,148 --> 00:01:11,608
Doctor prices: doctors see no prices by default. Grant or withhold prices for each doctor from here.

15
00:01:12,059 --> 00:01:14,529
Every table can be exported to Excel.

16
00:01:16,286 --> 00:01:22,406
That's it. Review spending every month, and keep catalog prices correct. Thank you!
